# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EDGE AI LAB NAVIGATION MENU  (www/menu-lab.jemdoc)
#
# The lab pages include THIS menu instead of www/menu.jemdoc, so the sidebar
# changes inside the lab without touching the rest of the site.
#
# Same rules as the main menu:
#   * a line WITHOUT brackets is a coloured section heading;
#   * a line with brackets is a link:  Visible text [target-file.html]
#
# The first line is the site name and links to the main site, exactly as in
# www/menu.jemdoc, so the two sidebars are built the same way. "Home" is the
# main site's home page too, and "Edge AI Lab" is the lab's own. The page
# heading at the top of every page also links home, so a visitor is never
# stranded.
#
# Careful: jemdoc marks the current entry with a SUFFIX test, so one page name
# must never be the tail of another -- that is why the lab's news page is
# lab-news.html. See guide.md §6.4.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Home [index.html]
Edge AI Lab
 Overview [lab.html]
 Members [lab-members.html]
 Projects [lab-projects.html]
 News [lab-news.html]
